{
  // Pure-function kits (all JS).
  //
  // checkJs is off: turning it on today reports 95 errors, nearly all of them
  // inside `glow`, which was adopted rather than written here and is written
  // dynamically throughout — noise rather than a gate. `inflect` carries JSDoc
  // types, which is what lets junction import it from TypeScript with no
  // .d.ts. Flip checkJs on per-directory when the JS here grows types worth
  // enforcing.
  "extends": "../../tsconfig.base.json",
  "compilerOptions": { "checkJs": false },
  "include": ["src/**/*.js", "test/**/*.js"]
}
